## Enumeration

### Gobuster — Web Directory Brute Forcing

```bash
gobuster dir -u http://10.10.158.205 -w /usr/share/wordlists/dirb/common.txt
```

Gobuster discovered a hidden path: `/simple`

Navigating to `http://10.10.158.205/simple` reveals a **CMS Made Simple** installation. The version number (**2.2.8**) is visible at the bottom of the page.

### Finding the Exploit

Searching for "CMS Made Simple 2.2.8" on [ExploitDB](https://www.exploit-db.com) returns:

- **Exploit:** [EDB-46635](https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46635)
- **CVE:** CVE-2019-9053
